                        <a id="modalLink" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored" class="flex-1 h-11 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold text-[14px] flex items-center justify-center">Continue to official site →</a>
